          "audio": "A medium-paced, upbeat synth-pop track plays with rhythmic percussion and electronic melodies.",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "A white digital workspace displays three distinct AI-generated images in horizontal frames. On the left is an orange-gold phoenix illustration. In the middle is an isometric diorama of an ancient Chinese water town with canals and traditional buildings. On the right is an abstract golden fluid-like sculpture. The camera is static. Lighting is bright, even, and artificial across the white background. Color palette is dominated by gold and earthy tones within the featured images.",
