          "timestamp_start": "0:00"
        },
        {
          "audio": "The background music continues at a consistent volume. Digital 'clicking' or 'tallying' sound effects sync with the movement of the rating bars.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "A white UI pop-up card appears in the center of the frame. Three progress bars with corresponding Chinese text labels animate horizontally from left to right. The first bar fills almost to the end, the second fills about three-quarters, and the third fills slightly more than halfway. Small black circles appear as sliders at the end of each bar. The lighting remains bright and flat with soft drop shadows behind the UI element.",
